 frame each side with two brackets.\n\nThe 150 cm used as supplied would work but it sits a little tight for clearing the glass.\n\nPlease allow 9 cm at each end for the finials beyond the 156 cm, so check that clearance first as cut poles cannot be returned.\n\nBest wishes, Rob","questions":[]},"fps":3}